# Analytical Takeaway

A wallet address rarely explains an investigation.

The value usually emerges through:

- Transaction timing
- Counterparty relationships
- Flow-of-funds reconstruction
- Exchange exposure
- Behavioral consistency
- Infrastructure reuse

Many blockchain investigations appear to begin with a wallet.

They often become solvable only after investigators reconstruct the broader network surrounding it.

